% yazi

# Open yazi in current directory
yazi

# Open yazi in a specific directory
yazi <directory>

# Print current dir on quit (use in cd wrapper)
yazi --cwd-file=<temp_file>

# Key: Open file preview / enter directory
# Key: Back to parent directory
# Key: Toggle hidden files
# Key: Search for files
# Key: Rename selected
# Key: Copy selected
# Key: Cut selected
# Key: Paste
# Key: Create new file or directory
# Key: Delete selected
# Key: Show help